01:04:01.570 --> 01:04:03.871
No. No, no.
Anything but that!


01:04:03.939 --> 01:04:05.873
Oh, this is so-- Mmm!
- No!


01:04:05.941 --> 01:04:07.942
Where is the client list, Chuck?


01:04:08.009 --> 01:04:10.244
I can't! I can't!


01:04:12.948 --> 01:04:14.949
