for one reason.


01:07:15.013 --> 01:07:17.048
She thought
you were rich.


01:07:18.383 --> 01:07:21.302
Okay. Rick's got cash,
which is why he's got Ashley.


01:07:21.369 --> 01:07:23.304
We can fake your coolness,


01:07:23.371 --> 01:07:26.958
