he stole from you.


01:08:25.851 --> 01:08:30.137
Swing half of them back to
your side, and his business is done.


01:08:34.659 --> 01:08:36.427
I'll take them all.


01:08:41.517 --> 01:08:44.001
So, we got the money.
Now what?


01:08:48.974 --> 01:08:51.108
Uh-oh.


01:08:56.732 --> 01:08:59.016
Is that all you got?
- Oh, shut up.


01:08:59.084 --> 01:09:02.486
I can't feel my abs anymore. I think
