01:09:12.747 --> 01:09:15.383
a horrible, disgusting
other man.


01:09:17.318 --> 01:09:20.087
Three!


01:09:24.226 --> 01:09:26.327
You ready?
- Let's do the thing.


01:09:26.395 --> 01:09:30.431
All right. Okay.
Okay.


