<i>Good for dinners and daytime</i>
<i>summer barbecues.</i>


01:09:33.384 --> 01:09:35.553
Yes.


01:09:38.490 --> 01:09:40.657
Any movies
after the third date.


01:09:40.725 --> 01:09:42.793
Nice.


01:09:50.818 --> 01:09:53.954
<i>Come on.</i>


01:09:54.022 --> 01:09:56.123
First meeting
of the parents.


01:09:56.190 --> 01:09:58.893
Birthdays and bar mitzvahs.


01:09:58.961 --> 01:10:01.095
Shoot. I knew that.
Let's go again.


01:10:10.255 --> 01:10:12.789
Oh. Sh-- I know. I looked.
Force of habit, okay?


01:10:12.857 --> 01:10:15.376
Ow! Okay.
It was-- Never mind.


01:10:16.578 --> 01:10:18.795
Oop.


01:10:18.863 --> 01:10:20.814
And I want summaries of all
the fall lines by tomorrow.


01:10:20.882 --> 01:10:21.807
How's your fitness?


01:10:21.808 --> 01:10:24.485
