to do the 8-minute abs now.


01:10:24.553 --> 01:10:26.487
Nice.


01:10:28.790 --> 01:10:32.042
Oh, guys. I'm so sorry.
I completely forgot.


01:10:32.110 --> 01:10:34.277
<i>Hey. Oh, come on.</i>


01:10:34.345 --> 01:10:36.080
Oh, come on, guys.


01:10:37.849 --> 01:10:40.501
Hey. Hey, you know, I'll come
in early tomorrow morning.


01:10:40.568 --> 01:10:43.036
All right? We're gonna
get this done. I promise.


01:10:48.259 --> 01:10:50.394
You know what, Britney?
I'm done with this.


01:10:50.461 --> 01:10:53.180
I'm done with the practice. I'm done
