01:10:53.247 --> 01:10:57.351
Okay. You're ready.


01:11:53.508 --> 01:11:56.243
Britney, you--
you were so amazing.


01:11:56.311 --> 01:11:58.312
You knew everywhere
that Ashley was gonna be.


01:11:58.380 --> 01:12:02.350
No. It's all you, Mike. I'm so proud
of how much of a dick you are now.


01:12:02.417 --> 01:12:05.018
Oh. Okay.


01:12:05.086 --> 01:12:07.488
You think I should her now?
- What? No, no, no, no.


01:12:07.556 --> 01:12:09.923
As soon as you pick up that
phone, you go from hunter to prey.


01:12:09.991 --> 01:12:15.730
No more balance.
- Okay. I'm breaking the rules!


01:12:18.567 --> 01:12:21.101
You're so good.
- What a day.


